Third-party notices
===================

The seed records of filaments in data/filaments (every record whose source is
"open-filament-database") are taken from the Open Filament Database, a project of the
OpenFilamentCollective that is published under the MIT licence. Only facts about the
filaments are used (temperatures, density, flow, drying, spools, colour names and hex
values); no image, text or purchase link is. Each record names its place in that database in
the field "source_ref". The data files are generated by tools/import_open_filament_db.py.

